  "_comment": "Canonical US auto-insurance carrier registry. Created Wave 36 / v3.0.14 for the insurance quote workflow self-reported current-carrier autocomplete. carriers[] is sourced verbatim from the user-supplied auto_insurance_company_customer_dropdown.xlsx \"Customer Dropdown\" sheet — 88 customer-facing US auto-insurance brands plus 4 catch-all rows tagged category \"Form option\" (other / not_sure / self_insured / no_insurance). `id` is a stable slug derived from displayName (the four Form-option rows use fixed slugs). Shape: { id, displayName, parentGroup, website, category }.",
