    "six_month_cents": 150000,
    "_comment": "US auto-insurance average ~$1,500 per 6 months (~$250/mo, ~$3,000/yr). Used by the self-reported-premium step: slider default + helper text. Consumers derive monthly (six_month_cents / 6) and annual (six_month_cents * 2) from this single source."
  },
