      "12mo": { "min_cents": 60000, "max_cents": 500000 }
    },
    "_comment": "Per-cadence slider bounds for the self-reported premium ($10 step): monthly $50-$1,500; 6mo $300-$5,000; 12mo $600-$5,000. The slider re-bounds when the cadence toggle changes — clamp the current value into the new range. The value is a raw dollar amount for the selected cadence; the savings calculation normalizes it to a 6-month basis."
